PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadYoureHereWithYourPokemon:: @ 8179DF6
	.string "NORMAN: BIRCH told me an\n"
	.string "outsider had found their\p"
	.string "partner. That must be you.\p"
	.string "This world gives us familiar\n"
	.string "roles. Do not mistake me for\p"
	.string "your real father.\p"
	.string "I guard one of the DIGITAL KEYS.\n"
	.string "First, help WALLY find a partner\p"
	.string "of his own.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyIdLikeAPokemon:: @ 8179F07
	.string "Um... I... I'd like to get a\n"
	.string "DIGIMON, please...$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadOhYoureWallyRight:: @ 8179F37
	.string "NORMAN: Hm? You're... Uh... Oh, right.\n"
	.string "You're WALLY, right?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyIveNeverCaughtAPokemon:: @ 8179F70
	.string "WALLY: I'm going to go stay with my\n"
	.string "relatives in VERDANTURF TOWN.\p"
	.string "I thought I would be lonely by myself,\n"
	.string "so I wanted to take a DIGIMON along.\p"
	.string "But I've never caught a DIGIMON before.\n"
	.string "I don't know how...$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadHmISee:: @ 817A03A
	.string "NORMAN: Hm. I see.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadPlayerGoWithWally:: @ 817A04A
	.string "NORMAN: {PLAYER}, you heard that,\n"
	.string "right?\p"
	.string "Go with WALLY and make sure that he\n"
	.string "safely catches a DIGIMON.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_IllLoanYouMyZigzagoon:: @ 817A0A8
	.string "WALLY, here, I'll loan you my DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "WALLY received a LOPMON!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyThankYouAndDadGivesPokeBall:: @ 817A0EB
	.string "WALLY: Oh, wow!\n"
	.string "A DIGIMON!\p"
	.string "NORMAN: Hm. I'll give you a DIGI DISK, too.\n"
	.string "Go for it!\p"
	.string "WALLY received a DIGI DISK!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyOhWowThankYou:: @ 817A156
	.string "WALLY: Oh, wow!\n"
	.string "Thank you!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WouldYouReallyComeWithMe:: @ 817A171
	.string "{PLAYER}... Would you really come\n"
	.string "with me?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadSoDidItWorkOut:: @ 817A196
	.string "NORMAN: So, did it work out?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyThankYouBye:: @ 817A1B0
	.string "WALLY: Thank you, yes, it did.\n"
	.string "Here's your DIGIMON back.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, thank you for coming along\n"
	.string "with me.\p"
	.string "You two are why I was able to catch\n"
	.string "my DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "I promise I'll take really good\n"
	.string "care of it.\p"
	.string "Oh! My mom's waiting for me, so I\n"
	.string "have to go!\p"
	.string "Bye, {PLAYER}!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadGoCollectBadges:: @ 817A2A4
	.string "NORMAN: Beyond this town lies\n"
	.string "RUSTBORO. ROXANNE guards the\p"
	.string "first DIGITAL KEY.\p"
	.string "Visit the other guardians after\n"
	.string "her. Return here when you hold\p"
	.string "four keys, and I will test your\n"
	.string "bond.\p"
	.string "All eight keys open EVER GRANDE.\n"
	.string "That is where your paths can\p"
	.string "meet.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanGoToRustboro:: @ 817A41E
	.string "NORMAN: Hm? Aren't you going to the\n"
	.string "DIGIMON GYM in RUSTBORO CITY?\p"
	.string "There's no challenge for me to\n"
	.string "battle a greenhorn TRAINER.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, I want you to challenge me\n"
	.string "when you become a lot stronger.\p"
	.string "I'll battle you, {PLAYER}, when you\n"
	.string "can show me four DIGITAL KEYS, okay?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanGoToDewford:: @ 817A518
	.string "NORMAN: I see... So, you've beaten the\n"
	.string "GYM LEADER in RUSTBORO CITY.\p"
	.string "But there are many more TRAINERS\n"
	.string "who are stronger than you, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "Across the sea in DEWFORD TOWN is a\n"
	.string "GYM LEADER named BRAWLY.\p"
	.string "You should go challenge him.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_YouHaveGottenStronger:: @ 817A5F3
	.string "NORMAN: Hm... {PLAYER}, you have gotten\n"
	.string "stronger.\p"
	.string "I can tell by the number of KEYS\n"
	.string "that you've earned.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanIntro:: @ 817A653
	.string "NORMAN: This world cast me as\n"
	.string "the guardian. I am only a\p"
	.string "guardian of the BALANCE KEY.\p"
	.string "Your bond must withstand this\n"
	.string "world's rules. Show me how you\p"
	.string "and your partner fight together!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanDefeat:: @ 817A77A
	.string "NORMAN: Your bond endured. The\n"
	.string "BALANCE KEY now belongs to you.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedBalanceBadge:: @ 817A7DD
	.string "{PLAYER} received DIGITAL KEY 5:\n"
	.string "BALANCE!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ExplainBalanceBadgeTakeThis:: @ 817A805
	.string "The BALANCE KEY restores access\n"
	.string "to SURF outside battle. Its\p"
	.string "other battle permissions remain\n"
	.string "active.\p"
	.string "This technique will help you\n"
	.string "cross the damaged world. Take it\p"
	.string "with you.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ExplainFacade:: @ 817A8CF
	.string "NORMAN: TM42 contains FACADE.\p"
	.string "It doubles the power of moves if\n"
	.string "the DIGIMON is poisoned, paralyzed,\l"
	.string "or burned.\p"
	.string "It might be able to turn a bad\n"
	.string "situation into an advantage.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadHappyAndSad:: @ 817A976
	.string "NORMAN: You saw through the role\n"
	.string "this world gave me. You held\p"
	.string "onto your real memories.\p"
	.string "Take the BALANCE KEY onward.\n"
	.string "Your real family is waiting\p"
	.string "beyond the breach.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallysParentsHaveGiftForYou:: @ 817A9F6
	.string "NORMAN: Oh, yes...\p"
	.string "WALLY's parents came calling\n"
	.string "earlier.\p"
	.string "They said that they had something\n"
	.string "they wanted to give you, {PLAYER}.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadGoingToKeepTraining:: @ 817AA6B
	.string "NORMAN: {PLAYER}, you should go visit\n"
	.string "your mother every so often.\p"
	.string "I'm going to stay here and redouble\n"
	.string "my training.\p"
	.string "It would bother me as a TRAINER to\n"
	.string "not avenge my loss to you, {PLAYER}!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadNoAmountOfTrainingIsEnough:: @ 817AB17
	.string "NORMAN: {PLAYER}, how are things going?\p"
	.string "The world of DIGIMON is deep.\p"
	.string "I honestly think that no amount of\n"
	.string "training would ever be enough.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice:: @ 817AB96
	.string "Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
	.string "bound {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "The doors in this GYM open when you\n"
	.string "beat the awaiting TRAINERS.\p"
	.string "Whoops! The doors in this room are\n"
	.string "already open, so don't attack me!\p"
	.string "The TRAINERS of PETALBURG GYM use\n"
	.string "all kinds of items.\p"
	.string "The door at the left leads to the\n"
	.string "SPEED ROOM.\p"
	.string "The door at the right leads to the\n"
	.string "ACCURACY ROOM.\p"
	.string "The room's name will be on the\n"
	.string "door, so choose carefully.\p"
	.string "Once you've chosen the door...\n"
	.string "Well, hey, go for it!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory:: @ 817AD49
	.string "You beat the BALANCE guardian!\n"
	.string "Another DIGITAL KEY is yours.\p"
	.string "Keep going. The gate home needs\n"
	.string "all eight.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallIntro:: @ 817ADA5
	.string "The ability to attack before the\n"
	.string "opponent...\p"
	.string "Just that alone puts me at a great\n"
	.string "advantage, don't you agree?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallDefeat:: @ 817AE11
	.string "That was a magnificent battle!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallPostBattle:: @ 817AE30
	.string "Go on to the next room where a new\n"
	.string "challenge awaits you.\p"
	.string "At the left is the ZERO REDUCTION\n"
	.string "ROOM.\p"
	.string "The right door leads to the DEFENSE\n"
	.string "ROOM.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallPostBadge:: @ 817AEBB
	.string "Whomever you beat, and whomever you\n"
	.string "may lose to, you never shirk from\l"
	.string "training yourself and your DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "That's what I think being a\n"
	.string "GYM LEADER is all about.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerIntro:: @ 817AF5A
	.string "Don't waste your time trying to\n"
	.string "lower my DIGIMON's abilities!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerDefeat:: @ 817AF98
	.string "My DIGIMON's abilities weren't\n"
	.string "harmed, but I still lost...$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerPostBattle:: @ 817AFD3
	.string "The next room is the STRENGTH ROOM.\n"
	.string "Can you withstand brute force?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerPostBadge:: @ 817B016
	.string "After you beat our LEADER, the\n"
	.string "training has become a lot tougher.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgeIntro:: @ 817B058
	.string "Just when you think you're going to\n"
	.string "win, your opponent restores HP...\p"
	.string "Can you just imagine how awful that\n"
	.string "must feel?\p"
	.string "I'll show you exactly how awful it\n"
	.string "feels!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgeDefeat:: @ 817B0F7
	.string "I couldn't restore HP enough...\n"
	.string "What ATTACK power...$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgePostBattle:: @ 817B12C
	.string "I should have expected no less from\n"
	.string "our LEADER's kid.\p"
	.string "No, wait! A TRAINER's abilities are\n"
	.string "earned only through effort.\p"
	.string "I lost because my own efforts\n"
	.string "weren't enough.\p"
	.string "Go on! The ONE-HIT KO ROOM is next.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgePostBadge:: @ 817B1F4
	.string "I'm going to keep training at GYMS.\n"
	.string "One day, I'll become a LEADER.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkeIntro:: @ 817B237
	.string "I'm not going to take it easy just\n"
	.string "because you're our LEADER's kid.\p"
	.string "I'll show you how horrid it is for\n"
	.string "a DIGIMON to take a critical hit!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkeDefeat:: @ 817B2C0
	.string "Your power...\n"
	.string "You're the real deal.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkePostBattle:: @ 817B2E4
	.string "The guardian really is strong. He's\n"
	.string "a TRAINER worth my respect.\p"
	.string "And, I sense the same glow coming\n"
	.string "from you as the guardian.\p"
	.string "I hope that you'll stage a terrific\n"
	.string "battle with the guardian!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkePostBadge:: @ 817B39B
	.string "Since your dad became the LEADER,\n"
	.string "the TRAINERS of PETALBURG CITY have\l"
	.string "become a lot tougher.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryIntro:: @ 817B3F7
	.string "Giggle...\n"
	.string "This is the ACCURACY ROOM.\p"
	.string "It's pretty nasty when every attack\n"
	.string "lands without fail.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryDefeat:: @ 817B454
	.string "You were a cut above me...$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryPostBattle:: @ 817B46F
	.string "There are some even stronger\n"
	.string "TRAINERS waiting for you.\p"
	.string "The left is the DEFENSE ROOM, and\n"
	.string "the right is the RECOVERY ROOM.\p"
	.string "Your DIGIMON's ATTACK power will be\n"
	.string "on trial either way.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryPostBadge:: @ 817B521
	.string "Do you know what we're trying to\n"
	.string "achieve as TRAINERS?\p"
	.string "We're striving to become soul mates\n"
	.string "with our DIGIMON.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_LoriIntro:: @ 817B58D
	.string "The higher the DEFENSE, the more\n"
	.string "reckless I can be in attack.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_LoriDefeat:: @ 817B5CB
	.string "Our defenses weren't enough...$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_LoriPostBattle:: @ 817B5EA
	.string "I think you've taught me a valuable\n"
	.string "lesson here.\p"
	.string "Now, go on! The left door goes to\n"
	.string "the STRENGTH ROOM.\p"
	.string "The right door opens to the\n"
	.string "ONE-HIT KO ROOM.\p"
	.string "Both of them have TRAINERS who are\n"
	.string "offensively skilled.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_LoriPostBadge:: @ 817B6B5
	.string "Hi! Have you tried using SURF?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyIntro:: @ 817B6D4
	.string "Our GYM LEADER told us to go all out\n"
	.string "and beat you.\p"
	.string "Even if you happen to be the\n"
	.string "LEADER's kid!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyDefeat:: @ 817B732
	.string "But... I went all out!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodiPostBattle:: @ 817B749
	.string "The way you use your DIGIMON...\n"
	.string "It's like the guardian's style.\p"
	.string "Go on through! The GYM LEADER, your\n"
	.string "guardian, is waiting!$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodiPostBadge:: @ 817B7C0
	.string "Sure, it's fine to make your DIGIMON\n"
	.string "stronger.\p"
	.string "But what decides the winner?\p"
	.string "Why, it's the feelings TRAINERS have for\n"
	.string "their DIGIMON.$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DoorAppearsLocked:: @ 817B844
	.string "This door appears to be locked\n"
	.string "right now...$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterSpeedRoom:: @ 817B870
	.string "“SPEED ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

UnknownString_817B8A8: @ 817B8A8
	.string "This door appears to be locked\n"
	.string "right now...$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterAccuracyRoom:: @ 817B8D4
	.string "“ACCURACY ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterZeroReductionRoom:: @ 817B90F
	.string "“ZERO REDUCTION ROOM,” the sign\n"
	.string "says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterDefenseRoom:: @ 817B950
	.string "“DEFENSE ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterRecoveryRoom:: @ 817B98A
	.string "“RECOVERY ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterStrengthRoom:: @ 817B9C5
	.string "“STRENGTH ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterOHKORoom:: @ 817BA00
	.string "“ONE-HIT KO ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterGymLeadersRoom:: @ 817BA3D
	.string "“GYM LEADER'S ROOM\p"
	.string "“See for yourself what DIGIMON await\n"
	.string "you!” the sign says.\p"
	.string "Do you want to go through?$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue:: @ 817BAA5
	.string "PETALBURG CITY DIGIMON GYM$"

PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified:: @ 817BAC0
	.string "PETALBURG CITY DIGIMON GYM\p"
	.string "NORMAN'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"
